---
import '../styles/global.css';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — JVA Music"
  description="Privacy policy for jva-music.com, covering Google Analytics 4 and Cloudflare analytics data collection."
  themeColor="#091528"
>
  <main class="privacy">
    <div class="privacy-inner">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: June 2026</p>

      <p>This site (jva-music.com) is operated by Jacobo Vega-Albela. This policy explains what data is collected when you visit and how it is used.</p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>This site uses two analytics services:</p>

      <h3>Google Analytics 4 (GA4)</h3>
      <p>GA4 collects data about how visitors use the site — pages visited, time on page, approximate geographic location (country/region level), device and browser type, and referral source. This data is processed by Google and stored on Google's servers. GA4 sets cookies (named <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_*</code>) that persist for up to two years.</p>
      <p>Google's data processing is governed by <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a>. You can opt out of GA4 tracking across all websites using the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>, or by blocking cookies in your browser settings.</p>

      <h3>Cloudflare Analytics</h3>
      <p>This site runs on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare collects server-side request logs including IP addresses, request paths, response codes, and timestamps for security and performance purposes. Cloudflare's data handling is governed by the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      <p>Cloudflare's analytics do not use cookies and do not track visitors across sites. IP addresses are anonymized before any aggregated analytics data is surfaced.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>The only cookies set by this site are the GA4 analytics cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_*</code>) described above. No other first-party cookies are used for tracking or advertising. You can delete or block cookies at any time through your browser settings.</p>

      <h2>No data sales or advertising</h2>
      <p>No personal data collected through this site is sold, rented, or shared with advertising networks. Analytics data is used solely to understand site usage and improve content.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy can be directed to <a href="mailto:jacobovamusic@gmail.com">jacobovamusic@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy {
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--cream);
    min-height: calc(100vh - var(--header-h));
    padding: 80px 28px 120px;
  }

  .privacy-inner {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .updated {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(245,243,238,0.4);
    margin: 0 0 48px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin: 48px 0 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(91,141,232,0.25);
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue-lt);
    margin: 28px 0 10px;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(245,243,238,0.82);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  a {
    color: var(--blue-lt);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: color 0.18s;
  }

  a:hover { color: var(--orange-lt); }

  code {
    font-size: 13px;
    background: rgba(91,141,232,0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(91,141,232,0.25);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    color: var(--blue-lt);
  }
</style>
